{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "fca25453-f267-8319-8994-54af2c665047",
  "created_at": "2026-03-09T13:12:18-04:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Doug Sisson",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Denise Arruda",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:10:33-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Denise, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:10:37-04:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi Denise, Doug Sisson. Sorry, I'm on my cell inside a warehouse, up on a mezzanine, so if I drop out just hang on."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:10:45-04:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem, go ahead. What's going on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:10:48-04:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's the drain at the low spot at the end of my block, 87 Malbone Road, up the North End. After the rain that ended Saturday, two days ago, it's still sitting under about a foot of water. A foot. It's Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:11:02-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A foot of water, still, after two days. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:11:06-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. And the sidewalk next to it is a sheet of mud and grit, [line breaks up] you can't walk it without, I mean, you'd slide right into the street. It's like a cabinet, you know, a milkshake, what they call it up here, only it's brown and it's on the sidewalk."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:11:22-04:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, I know what you mean. So the grit all washed up out of the drain."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:11:28-04:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I guess so. Look, what I want to know is when did they last come by? Somebody cleaning it out. Because it does this every time it rains, and nobody ever seems to show up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:11:39-04:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I don't have the cleaning schedule in front of me for that particular drain. Let me put in a request with the crew so it gets looked at, and I'll note it's still holding a foot of water. Can you give me a number in case they need to reach you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:11:55-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, it's 401-555-0168. [inaudible] can you, did you get that?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:11:59-04:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six eight, I've got it. I'll flag the last cleaning question too, and someone from the crew side can call you back with it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:12:08-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. I just want somebody to actually come this time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:12:12-04:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Understood. It's in as of now. Take care, Doug."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-03-09T13:12:16-04:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, thanks Denise."
    }
  ],
